In the long term, Cheyenne should pursue premium
transit options such as commuter rail or bus rapid
transit (BRT). Elements contained in PlanCheyenne and
the Transportation Plan are the first steps on a path to
this type of transit service. As transit service is
expanded, future plans may look more closely at
