transit routes in areas designated for higher density or
mixed-use development, the transit system can begin
to reach more residents and workers as Cheyenne
grows. By continuing to adapt the transit system
service as the Cheyenne Area grows and changes, the
community can prepare for even more sophisticated
transit service in the future.
