for distribution to the various counties and placed in the
County’s Road Construction and Maintenance Fund. The
distribution of gasoline tax is as follows: WYDOT, 57.5%;
Counties, 27.5%; and Municipalities, 15%. Diesel tax revenues
are distributed under WSS § 39-17-211 and are as follows:
